269
00:41:30,591 --> 00:41:34,461
You buy any of this , Blair ?

270
00:41:43,937 --> 00:41:47,808
[ Typing , Ticking ]

271
00:43:33,413 --> 00:43:36,350
[ Copper On Intercom ] Mac , we 're movin ' those things ...

272
00:43:36,416 --> 00:43:38,552
