273
00:43:38,652 --> 00:43:41,522
Can you come get your stuff ?

274
00:43:41,588 --> 00:43:44,525
Be there in a minute , Doc .

275
00:44:00,541 --> 00:44:02,609
Through the door .

276
00:44:05,979 --> 00:44:08,415
