286
00:44:48,889 --> 00:44:51,425
Can 't burn the find of the century .

287
00:44:51,525 --> 00:44:55,095
That 's gonna win somebody the Nobel Prize .

288
00:45:07,140 --> 00:45:09,076
You got the keys ?

289
00:45:09,142 --> 00:45:12,579
Get ' em from Garry . I want to get some stuff out of here .

290
00:45:46,713 --> 00:45:48,649
