291
00:45:48,715 --> 00:45:51,018
He 's locked in his room and won 't answer the door .

292
00:45:51,084 --> 00:45:56,056
- I took one of his notebooks from the lab . Listen . - Yeah ?

293
00:45:56,657 --> 00:46:00,594
" It could have imitated a million life-forms on a million planets .

294
00:46:00,694 --> 00:46:03,063
