295
00:46:03,130 --> 00:46:05,566
- Now it wants life-forms on Earth ... " - It 's gettin ' cold ,

296
00:46:05,632 --> 00:46:08,068
- and I haven 't slept in two days . - Wait a minute , Mac .

297
00:46:08,135 --> 00:46:11,839
" It needs to be alone and in close proximity with the life-form to be absorbed .

298
00:46:11,939 --> 00:46:14,908
- The chameleon strikes in the dark . " - Is Blair cracking up ?

299
00:46:14,975 --> 00:46:18,512
Damn it , MacReady . " There 's still cellular activity in these burned remains .

300
00:46:18,612 --> 00:46:21,882
They 're not dead yet . "

301
00:46:31,058 --> 00:46:34,228
Let 's go , Bennings . I gotta get some sleep .

302
00:46:52,679 --> 00:46:56,316
Holy shit .

303
00:46:59,253 --> 00:47:00,821
