304
00:47:00,921 --> 00:47:02,890
Go get the doc .

305
00:47:02,956 --> 00:47:07,394
- I 'll get Garry . We 'll meet in Blair 's room . - All right .

306
00:47:12,299 --> 00:47:14,234
It 's Bennings !

307
00:47:24,611 --> 00:47:28,549
