338
00:51:51,512 --> 00:51:55,449
[ Electrical Sparking ]

339
00:52:05,192 --> 00:52:07,127
[ Gunshot ]

340
00:52:15,769 --> 00:52:20,707
[ Blair ] Don 't come in here ! I got a gun ! I got an ax !

341
00:52:20,774 --> 00:52:24,444
Don 't , you son of a bitch ! Don 't come in here ! You understand me ?

342
00:52:24,545 --> 00:52:27,548
- He 's got a gun , Mac ! - Anybody interferes , I 'll kill ' im !

343
