- [ Bullet Ricochets ] - Jesus !

344
00:52:29,650 --> 00:52:33,086
- [ Blair Yelling Indistinctly ] - He smashed up some of the chopper pretty good .

345
00:52:33,153 --> 00:52:36,423
Childs , go see if he got to the tractor .

346
00:52:36,490 --> 00:52:41,562
[ Clanging , Yelling ] Nobody gets in and out of here ! Nobody !

347
00:52:46,500 --> 00:52:51,038
You guys think I 'm crazy ! Well , that 's fine !

348
00:52:51,138 --> 00:52:55,075
Most of ya don 't know what 's going on around here !

349
00:52:55,175 --> 00:52:59,112
But I 'm damn well sure some of you do !

350
00:52:59,179 --> 00:53:01,915
Christ !

351
00:53:04,351 --> 00:53:08,155
He got most of the chopper and the tractor , and he 's killed the rest of the dogs .

352
00:53:08,288 --> 00:53:11,692
