353
00:53:11,692 --> 00:53:14,728
Garry , wait a minute ! Wait a minute !

354
00:53:14,828 --> 00:53:17,865
All right , Childs , go around to the map room door ,

355
00:53:17,965 --> 00:53:19,900
- talk to him . - Okay .

356
00:53:19,967 --> 00:53:21,902
Go on .

357
00:53:21,969 --> 00:53:23,937
Norris , get a table from the lab .

358
00:53:24,004 --> 00:53:29,776
