359
00:53:29,843 --> 00:53:33,013
No dogs make it a thousand miles through the cold .

360
00:53:33,113 --> 00:53:35,849
[ Glass Shattering ]

361
00:53:35,949 --> 00:53:39,253
No , you don 't understand !

362
00:53:39,319 --> 00:53:41,355
That thing wanted to be us !

363
00:53:41,455 --> 00:53:46,894
A cell gets out , it could imitate everything on the face of the earth !

364
00:53:46,994 --> 00:53:49,563
- [ Blair ] And nothing could stop it ! - Okay , Blair ,

365
00:53:49,663 --> 00:53:53,066
come on now , you don 't want to hurt anybody .

366
00:53:53,133 --> 00:53:56,136
