409
00:57:12,933 --> 00:57:15,869
[ Garry ] Yeah . Yeah .

410
00:57:19,273 --> 00:57:22,843
Mac , we need Blair 's help . He 's the only one ...

411
00:57:22,943 --> 00:57:25,379
- who knows what this organism is capable of . - He 's too far gone , Fuchs .

412
00:57:25,445 --> 00:57:29,183
