435
00:58:57,004 --> 00:58:59,907
- Copper 's the only one who 's got any business with it . - [ Copper ] Wait a minute !

436
00:58:59,973 --> 00:59:02,476
- You 've been in here on several occasions ! - Doc thought of the test .

437
00:59:02,576 --> 00:59:05,646
- That clears him ? Bullshit ! - Why would he take ...

438
00:59:05,746 --> 00:59:07,814
- [ MacReady ] Shut up , man ! - Windows ! - Windows !

439
00:59:21,762 --> 00:59:23,697
[ Cocks Pistol ] Put that down .

440
00:59:23,764 --> 00:59:27,835
- No . - I 'll put this right through your head .

441
00:59:27,935 --> 00:59:31,371
You guys gonna listen to Garry , let him give the orders ?

442
00:59:31,438 --> 00:59:33,841
He could be one of those things !

443
00:59:33,907 --> 00:59:37,511
Windows , wait a minute . Just take it easy .

444
00:59:37,611 --> 00:59:39,847
Put the gun down . Put it down .

445
00:59:39,947 --> 00:59:42,549
- Garry , you don 't want to hurt anybody . - Get back .

446
00:59:42,649 --> 00:59:45,285
