474
01:02:06,560 --> 01:02:10,631
All right , Doc , Garry and Clark move over there away from the others .

475
01:02:22,643 --> 01:02:27,114
Norris , you and Childs shoot ' em up with morphine . Tie ' em down and watch ' em .

476
