488
01:03:42,589 --> 01:03:46,960
Windows found some shredded long johns , but the name tag was missing .

489
01:03:47,027 --> 01:03:50,964
They could be anybody 's .

490
01:03:51,031 --> 01:03:54,768
Nobody ...

491
01:03:54,868 --> 01:03:58,305
Nobody trusts anybody now .

492
01:03:58,372 --> 01:04:00,974
And we 're all very tired .

