Blair 's been busy out here all by himself .

745
01:28:58,071 --> 01:29:01,808
- What is it ? - Something he 's been making .

746
01:29:01,909 --> 01:29:05,145
It 's a ship of some kind .

747
01:29:05,245 --> 01:29:07,481
He stole the parts from the helicopter .

748
01:29:07,581 --> 01:29:11,985
Smart s.o.b. He put it together piece by piece .

749
01:29:12,085 --> 01:29:14,821
Where was he tryin ' to go ?

750
01:29:14,922 --> 01:29:17,991
Anyplace but here .

751
01:29:56,230 --> 01:29:59,666
Hey , you guys , come here . Come here .

752
01:30:05,906 --> 01:30:09,810
I think I saw Childs outside the main entrance of the camp .

753
01:30:09,910 --> 01:30:12,679
- What 's he doing outside ? - I don 't know .

754
01:30:23,657 --> 01:30:25,926
Got a flare ?

755
01:30:26,026 --> 01:30:27,995
[ Lights Flare ]

756
01:30:28,095 --> 01:30:31,665
He got back inside and blew the generator .

757
01:30:33,433 --> 01:30:36,270
In six hours , it 'll be 100 below in here .

758
01:30:36,370 --> 01:30:38,405
Well , that 's suicide !

759
01:30:38,505 --> 01:30:40,841
Not for that thing .

760
01:30:40,941 --> 01:30:43,343
It wants to freeze now .

761
01:30:43,443 --> 01:30:47,848
It 's got no way outta here . It just wants to go to sleep until the rescue team finds it .

762
01:30:49,883 --> 01:30:52,986
What can we do ? What can we do ?

763
01:30:53,086 --> 01:30:58,792
Whether we make it or not , we can 't let that thing freeze again .

764
01:30:58,892 --> 01:31:02,796
Maybe we 'll just warm things up a little around here .

765
01:31:06,733 --> 01:31:09,570
We 're not gettin outta here alive ...

766
01:31:11,572 --> 01:31:13,841
but neither is that thing .

767
01:33:03,016 --> 01:33:05,118
Generator room .

768
01:33:15,863 --> 01:33:18,632
[ Distant Explosion ]

769
01:34:12,519 --> 01:34:14,621
Generator 's gone .

770
01:34:14,688 --> 01:34:17,191
Anyway we can fix it ?

771
01:34:17,257 --> 01:34:21,361
It 's gone , MacReady .

772
01:34:29,036 --> 01:34:34,808
All right . We gotta bring this whole place right down into the ice .

773
01:34:34,875 --> 01:34:38,645
Garry , plant yours in the old storage room .

774
01:34:38,712 --> 01:34:41,481
Nauls , down by the generator .

775
01:35:31,265 --> 01:35:34,034
[ Bangs On Headlamp ] Oh , God .

776
01:35:41,441 --> 01:35:47,214
[ Gasping ]

777
01:35:47,281 --> 01:35:49,583
[ Groaning ]

778
01:35:49,650 --> 01:35:54,054
[ Groaning Continues ]

779
01:36:12,339 --> 01:36:16,343
[ Indistinct Noise ]

780
01:36:43,437 --> 01:36:47,274
How 's it comin ' in there ?

781
01:36:47,341 --> 01:36:50,644
- I said , " How 's it ... " - [ Indistinct Banging ]

782
01:37:41,228 --> 01:37:45,499
[ MacReady Yelling ]

783
01:38:05,385 --> 01:38:08,522
[ Roars ]

784
01:38:08,589 --> 01:38:14,161
[ Roaring Continues ]

785
01:38:34,615 --> 01:38:37,751
Yeah , fuck you too !

786
01:38:37,818 --> 01:38:40,254
- [ Dynamite Sizzling ] - [ Yelps ]

787
01:38:40,320 --> 01:38:44,458
[ Thing Roaring , Screeching ]

788
01:38:44,525 --> 01:38:46,960
[ Screaming ]

789
01:40:01,535 --> 01:40:04,805
You the only one who made it ?

790
01:40:04,872 --> 01:40:08,308
Not the only one .

791
01:40:08,375 --> 01:40:10,511
Did you kill it ?

792
01:40:11,879 --> 01:40:14,982
Where were you , Childs ?

793
01:40:15,048 --> 01:40:17,551
Thought I saw Blair .

794
01:40:17,618 --> 01:40:20,821
I went out after him ...

795
01:40:20,888 --> 01:40:24,491
and got lost in the storm .

796
01:40:24,558 --> 01:40:26,493
[ Groans ]

797
01:40:29,730 --> 01:40:32,833
[ Laughs ]

798
01:40:32,900 --> 01:40:36,503
Fires got the temperature up all over the camp .

799
01:40:38,071 --> 01:40:40,407
Won 't last long though .

800
01:40:40,474 --> 01:40:44,444
Neither will we .

801
01:40:44,511 --> 01:40:48,282
How will we make it ?

802
01:40:48,348 --> 01:40:52,152
Maybe we shouldn 't .

803
01:40:55,022 --> 01:40:57,558
If you 're worried about me ...

804
01:40:57,624 --> 01:41:01,461
If we 've got any surprises for each other ,

805
01:41:01,528 --> 01:41:05,933
I don 't think we 're in much shape to do anything about it .

806
01:41:09,536 --> 01:41:13,874
Well ... what do we do ?

807
01:41:13,941 --> 01:41:17,978
Why don 't we just ...

808
01:41:18,045 --> 01:41:22,149
wait here for a little while ,

809
01:41:22,216 --> 01:41:25,219
see what happens .

810
01:41:25,285 --> 01:41:28,155
Yeah .

811
01:41:34,828 --> 01:41:37,497
[ Groans ]

812
01:41:45,672 --> 01:41:47,941
[ Sighs ]

813
01:41:48,008 --> 01:41:51,778
[ Laughs ]

814
01:48:05,185 --> 01:48:09,156
Subtitles Provided By Captions , Inc . Los Angeles

